      "date": "2026-11-04 16:05:08.000000000",
      "message": "Patch Set 1: Verified+1\n\nPassed enforced test review-dne-part-3 on RHEL 10.2 / x86_64 uploaded by Trevis Autotest from trevis-153vm328: https://testing.whamcloud.com/test_sessions/ce73dcba-a778-4c21-bb9d-fb84d9c2ea00 ran 3 tests.",
